  "notes": "Cash-basis county, all governmental. Statement receipts/disbursements from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Taxes 8,211,824 split per Statement of Activities general receipts (p2: Property, Motor vehicle, Lodging, Other); the Public Safety Sales Tax Fund's taxes 427,810 (p9) taken out of 'Other' as sales tax by fund name. Local 2,759,827 split per p2 (charges for services, interest income, miscellaneous; remainder 85,730 = Minority Health Initiative grant counted in operating grants). Lease proceeds recorded as debt_proceeds. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Statement of Assets and Fund Balances (p3), whose totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p11, departments, no object breakdown) used instead of the General Fund combining column; Inheritance Tax Fund column from the combining page (p5); Road, ARPA and Insurance budget schedules (pp12-14); 15 nonmajor funds recorded from the Total Nonmajor Funds column (p10) with taxes split by fund. Read pages 1-14 of 14"
